# NIIMBOT (精臣) PC C++ SDK 4.0.6 runtime payload.
#
# These are vendor binaries (jcPrinterApi.dll and its 7 dependencies, the
# icudtl.dat data file and the ZT001.ttf font). They are NOT project source:
# the repository Git boundary rejects *.dll and large binary payloads, and the
# files are reproducible from the registered archive. Only this .gitignore is
# tracked; restore the payload on a build machine with:
#
#   python tools/restore_niimbot_runtime.py
#
# See ../README.md for the source archive, SHA256 list and upgrade procedure.
*
!.gitignore
